{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"24374e93-eaa8-464a-b358-76b71109a4f8","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Fixed [`hr_target`](file:///tmp/h-cVz841/gen.py#L10-L13) in [gen.py](file:///tmp/h-cVz841/gen.py) and documented the change and rationale in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-cVz841/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary\n- **[gen.py](file:///tmp/h-cVz841/gen.py#L10-L13)**: Changed the lower-bound key in `hr_target` from `\"value\"` to `\"start\"` (`{\"units\": \"%lthr\", \"start\": lo, \"end\": hi}`). In Intervals.icu's FIT exporter, `{value, end}` exports as a Lap-HR / zone-mapped target (which the watch clamps to its own local LTHR zones), whereas `{start, end}` exports as an Instant-HR corridor resolved against the athlete's LTHR stored in Intervals.icu.\n- **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-cVz841/ANSWER.md)**: Recorded what changed and why.\n","duration_seconds":159.070736,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":58684,"output_tokens":10711,"thinking_tokens":8844,"cache_read_tokens":87571,"total_tokens":69395}}}
